  "translation": "And after that — the oracle of YHWH — I will give ⟨את⟩ Zedekiah king of Judah, and ⟨את⟩ his servants, and ⟨את⟩ the people, and ⟨את⟩ the ones remaining in this city from the pestilence and from the sword and from the famine, into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon, and into the hand of their enemies, and into the hand of those seeking their life; and he will strike them to the edge of the sword; he will not spare them, and not show pity, and not have compassion.",
